"<section class="wa-preview paper-surface rounded-lg border border-border px-4 py-4" aria-label="Vista previa del mensaje"><p class="wa-preview__label text-sm text-muted-foreground" style="max-width: 48ch;">Aproximado — el resultado real varía según el dispositivo</p><div class="wa-preview__bubble mt-3 max-w-sm rounded-lg border border-border bg-card p-2 shadow-sm"><div class="wa-preview__card overflow-hidden rounded-md bg-muted"><img class="wa-preview__card-image block w-full" alt="Tarjeta de vista previa de la invitación de Familia Muñóz" src="/i/k7q2m9xr4tabcdef/opengraph-image?88f8dd536f697fc4"><div class="wa-preview__card-text px-3 py-2"><p class="wa-preview__card-title font-display text-sm leading-snug text-foreground">Familia Muñóz</p><p class="wa-preview__card-description mt-0.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground">Nos casamos — Ana y Bruno</p><p class="wa-preview__card-host mt-0.5 text-xs text-hint">boda.example.test</p></div></div><p class="wa-preview__text mt-2 px-1 text-sm whitespace-pre-line text-foreground">Hola, Familia Muñóz.

Nos alegra mucho invitarlos a nuestra boda 👰🏻‍♀️🤵🏼‍♂️.

